 '[{"text":"Rayleigh scattering","isCorrect":true},{"text":"Total internal reflection","isCorrect":false},{"text":"Diffraction","isCorrect":false},{"text":"Polarization only","isCorrect":false}]'::jsonb,
 null, 'Rayleigh scattering of sunlight by air molecules is much stronger for shorter (blue) wavelengths, scattering blue light across the sky and giving it its color.'),

